// in `coverage.fallbacks[]`, read back by golden test data and by `FORMAT.md`, and renaming it is
// a document-format change out of scope here. This file only adds an English snake_case name for
// the one place that name reaches a human-facing log line — `replay/fallbacks_publication.go`'s
// "replay: fallback triggered" — so server.log stays readable without touching the published
// contract.
//
// TestEveryRegistryEntryHasAnEnglishName (english_names_test.go) walks [Table] and fails if any
// entry has no English name here, so a new French [Repli.Nom] cannot slip into the log unnoticed.

